      "priority": "normal",
      "comment": "I want this section to be an overview of the region. Something like \"The Hunter hosts the largest coal export terminal in the world and is a major industrial hub in Australia, providing a unique testbed for our framework. If we can achieve substantial\nchange in the Hunter, we can apply those\nlessons to other regions.\nThe Hunter is responsible for 11% of Australia’s domestic emissions,10 11 12 13 and the coal exported from the Port of Newcastle generates emissions overseas equivalent to 80% of Australia’s total\ndomestic emissions, according to our analysis14.\nThe region is home to coal-fired power plants, numerous coal mines, and major industrial sites such as Tomago Aluminium and Orica’s Kooragang Island operations.\nThe Hunter is one of sixteen key industrial regions we have identified as a potential Renewable Energy Industrial Precinct\" \n\nFeel free to add and remove and edit this. Also from a design picture I would like to add a image from the region somewhere here. \n\nI would like to simmilar changes to the Port Hedland, Kwinana and Gladstone pages as well. I will paste some suggested text for each in chat.",
